    "page_title": "Custom Metallic Gold Stickers | Brushed Gold Sheet",
    "meta_description": "Custom metallic gold stickers with a brushed glossy finish on water and tear-resistant vinyl. No Minimum, no setup fees, fast delivery.",
    "reviews_count": 0,
